+- **Armoury purchase:** needs the Raid Charter; Shards per level 1/2/3/5/8.
+- **Raider's Charm:** the recipe is known on an existing save. Over 600
+  Normal runs, seek moved average drops 0.47 → 0.93 and boost 0.47 → 0.59,
